# InChi Pilot Gateway — Root .gitignore
# Owned by: Ajendra Nath Tripathi (Cybersecurity and DevSecOps Engineer)
# AGENTS.md §C2, ARCHITECTURE.md §4.1, MVP_FEATURES §8

# ==============================================================================
# SECRETS BASELINE & ENVIRONMENT VARIABLES (MANDATORY)
# AGENTS.md §B rule 7: Never commit real credentials, tokens, or environment files.
# Commit ONLY placeholder values in .env.example.
# ==============================================================================
.env
.env.*
.env.local
.env.development.local
.env.test.local
.env.production.local
!.env.example

# Secret keys, credentials & certificates
*.pem
*.key
*.cert
*.crt
*.pfx
*.p12
id_rsa
id_ecdsa
id_ed25519
*.id_rsa
*.id_ed25519
secrets/
credentials/
auth_tokens/

# ==============================================================================
# PYTHON & DJANGO ARTIFACTS
# ==============================================================================
